\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterFlame} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一段教會歷史，是來看聖靈自己如何做工。\\
若你讀完二十八章卻只記得地名與人名——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意，每一次逼迫、每一道門的打開，主角始終只有一位。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading church history — you are watching the Spirit at work.\\
If after twenty-eight chapters you remember only names and places, read it again.\\
This time notice: through every persecution, every open door, there is only one Actor.}
\end{minipage}

