\noindent 本書「歷代注疏」與「老弟兄查經」各節所引用的注釋家與著作如下，依時代排列。

\section*{教父時期 Patristic}

\begin{itemize}
\item Chrysostom, John (c.\,347–407). \textit{Homilies on the Acts of the Apostles}. In \textit{Nicene and Post-Nicene Fathers}, Series 1, Vol.\ 11 (NPNF1-11). Ed.\ Philip Schaff. Buffalo: Christian Literature Company, 1889. 本書引用之講道編號見各章註明。
\end{itemize}

\section*{改革宗時期 Reformation}

\begin{itemize}
\item Calvin, John (1509–1564). \textit{Commentary upon the Acts of the Apostles}, Vols.\ 1–2. Trans.\ Christopher Fetherstone. Edinburgh: Calvin Translation Society. 電子版見 Christian Classics Ethereal Library (CCEL)。
\item Henry, Matthew (1662–1714). \textit{An Exposition of the Old and New Testament}（《馬太亨利聖經注釋》）。
\end{itemize}

\section*{近代與當代釋經 Modern \& Contemporary Commentary}

\begin{itemize}
\item Morgan, G. Campbell (1863–1945). \textit{The Acts of the Apostles}. New York: Fleming H. Revell, 1924. 另引 \textit{Searchlights from the Word} 及 \textit{Exposition on the Whole Bible}。
\item MacArthur, John (b. 1939). \textit{The MacArthur New Testament Commentary: Acts 1–12, 13–28}. Chicago: Moody Publishers. \\ 講道系列 "Acts" (44V1 起)，錄音與講章見 gty.org；本書所引各篇之講道編號見各章註明。
\item Stott, John (1921–2011). \textit{The Message of Acts}. BST. Downers Grove: IVP, 1990.
\end{itemize}

\section*{延伸閱讀 Further Reading（本書未直接引用）}

\begin{itemize}
\item Bruce, F.F. \textit{The Book of the Acts}. NICNT. Grand Rapids: Eerdmans.
\item Polhill, John B. \textit{Acts}. NAC. Nashville: Broadman \& Holman, 1992.
\end{itemize}

\section*{中文查經資源 Chinese-Language Bible Study Resources}

\begin{itemize}
\item 老弟兄（Elder Wong）查經法。\textbf{本書各章「老弟兄查經」並非逐字語錄}：現存資料中沒有老弟兄講解使徒行傳的第一手筆記，各節係編者按其一貫查經方法與語氣撮述而成，讀者不應視為其本人的原話。其查經方法之依據，見《約翰福音研讀》全書領受總綱。
\end{itemize}

